OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order to appeal High Court
OL,4,Ainjunction stopping Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt came after Portadown District Orange
OL,7,FLodge declined a request from Judge
OL,8,FPatricia Smyth to postpone the parade
OL,9,Funtil all issues were properly
OL,10,Fconsidered.
